sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectImages
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SetCoverImageBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SetCoverImageController
  participant ProjectImage as «entity»<br/>ProjectImage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: choose the cover photo
  UI->>B: PUT /api/designer/projects/{id}/images/{imageId}/cover (JWT)
  B->>C: setCover(Integer designerId, Integer projectId, Integer imageId)
  C->>ProjectImage: findByProject()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectImage: save()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C-->>B: List<ImageResponse>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result